{"id": "418acdecc02f491", "title": "雷波县小沟磷矿采选工程中转场及管道输送项目河道治理方案与行洪论证技术服务项目比选公告", "sourceUrl": "https://ggzyjy.sc.gov.cn/jyxx/002010/002010001/20260713/1dd3e3b3-eb92-4003-b39c-e3cf76cb8b26.html", "date": "2026-07-13", "source": "四川公共资源交易中心", "category": "002010001", "content": "雷波县小沟磷矿采选工程中转场及管道输送项目河道治理方案与行洪论证技术服务项目\n项目\n公开比选公告\n根据四川发展天盛矿业有限公司实际发展需要，需开展雷波县小沟磷矿采选工程中转场及管道输送项目河道治理方案与行洪论证技术服务机构选聘，选聘一家单位开展相关服务工作\n，\n兹欢迎符合条件的相关单位参加本项目的公开比选。\n一、\n报名时间\n2026\n年\n7\n月\n13\n日\n9:\n3\n0——\n2026\n年\n7\n月\n15\n日\n17:\n3\n0\n二\n、参选单位资格要求\n（一）\n须在中华人民共和国境内注册\n，\n具备\n独立承担民事责任的能力\n（若为分公司，\n需\n提供总公司相应授权说明）；\n（二）\n须具有良好的商业信誉，近一年内\n（\n2025\n年\n1\n月\n1\n日至今）\n或成立至今（成立不足\n一\n年的单位）在日常经营活动中未出现重大违法经营行为，\n未处于有关行政处罚期间，未被列入工商系统经营异常名录或严重违法失信企业名单，未被列入人民法院公布的失信被执行人名单\n；\n（三）\n财务状况基本要求：\n近一年内（\n2025\n年\n1\n月\n1\n日至今）或成立至今财务状况无亏损或净资产大于\n0\n；\n（四）\n近两年内（\n2024\n年\n1\n月\n1\n日至今）至少具备一项正在实施或已完成的类似业绩，类似业绩指：\n技术服务\n相关业绩（业绩须提供中标（成交）通知书或合同协议书）\n；\n（五）\n单位负责人为同一人或者存在直接控股、管理关系的不同供应商，不得参加同一合同项下的采购活动；\n（六）\n不接受联合体参选\n。\n三\n、响应性文件获取方式\n凡有意报名参与本项目的比选申请人，请于报名时间内注册并登陆西南联合产权交易所招采平台\n（\nhttp://www.swueecg.com/#/index\n）\n，按照网上操作流程（资料下载\n-操作手册）获取比选文件（\n招采平台咨询\n热线\n：\n028-86123300\n）。\n四\n、\n选聘材料提交\n（一）\n响应文件递交截止时间\n及\n公开比选开始时间\n均\n为\n2026\n年\n7\n月\n17\n日\n9\n时\n30\n分\n（\n北京时间\n）\n；\n（二）\n响应文件递交\n方式\n本次文件递交方式采用\n线上递交，具体如下：\n响应\n文件必须在递交截止时间前上传\n，\n操作\n流程\n：本项目采用全流程电子化在线开评标方式，请各参选单位通过西南联合产权交易所阳光采购平台（\nhttps://swueecg.com/#/index\n）\n“\n统一注册登录入口\n”\n，进入【供应商工作台\n-\n投标系统\n-\n阳光采购平台\n1.0\n专区】，在线参与项目、递交\nPDF\n盖章版参选文件。参选文件递交截止时间前未完成参选文件上传的，视为放弃参选。参选过程中请密切通过阳光采购平台关注项目进度。\n五\n、联系方式\n联系人：\n申先生\n电\n话：\n0834-6979908\n邮\n箱：\n/\n四川发展天盛矿业有限\n公司\n2026\n年\n7\n月\n13\n日", "html": "<div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"newsText\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 43px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 长城小; font-size: 29px;\">雷波县小沟磷矿采选工程中转场及管道输送项目河道治理方案与行洪论证技术服务项目</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 长城小; font-size: 29px;\">项目</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: 长城小; font-size: 29px;\">公开比选公告</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 43px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 21.3333px;\">根据四川发展天盛矿业有限公司实际发展需要，需开展雷波县小沟磷矿采选工程中转场及管道输送项目河道治理方案与行洪论证技术服务机构选聘，选聘一家单位开展相关服务工作</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">，</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">兹欢迎符合条件的相关单位参加本项目的公开比选。</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0000pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd; text-indent: 32.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 32.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">一、</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">报名时间</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">日</span> 9:</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\">0——</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">15</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">日</span>17:</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\">0</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">二</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">、参选单位资格要求</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; layout-grid-mode: char; punctuation-wrap: simple; text-autospace: none; mso-pagination: none; mso-outline-level: 1; line-height: 32.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（一）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">须在中华人民共和国境内注册</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">具备</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">独立承担民事责任的能力</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（若为分公司，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">需</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">提供总公司相应授权说明）；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（二）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">须具有良好的商业信誉，近一年内</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">日至今）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">或成立至今（成立不足</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">一</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年的单位）在日常经营活动中未出现重大违法经营行为，</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">未处于有关行政处罚期间，未被列入工商系统经营异常名录或严重违法失信企业名单，未被列入人民法院公布的失信被执行人名单</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（三）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">财务状况基本要求：</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">近一年内（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">日至今）或成立至今财务状况无亏损或净资产大于</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">；</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（四）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">近两年内（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">日至今）至少具备一项正在实施或已完成的类似业绩，类似业绩指：</span></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">技术服务</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">相关业绩（业绩须提供中标（成交）通知书或合同协议书）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（五）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">单位负责人为同一人或者存在直接控股、管理关系的不同供应商，不得参加同一合同项下的采购活动；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">（六）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">不接受联合体参选</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: 'yes'; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">三</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">、响应性文件获取方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; text-indent: 32.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 32.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">凡有意报名参与本项目的比选申请人，请于报名时间内注册并登陆西南联合产权交易所招采平台</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（</span>http://www.swueecg.com/#/index<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">，按照网上操作流程（资料下载</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">-操作手册）获取比选文件（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">招采平台咨询</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">热线</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">028-86123300</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">）。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">四</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">选聘材料提交</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 16pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（一）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">响应文件递交截止时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">及</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">公开比选开始时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">均</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">为</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">2026</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">7</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">17</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">日</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">9</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">时</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">30</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">分</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">北京时间</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">；</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 16pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（二）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">响应文件递交</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.0000pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; line-height: 32.0000pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">本次文件递交方式采用</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">线上递交，具体如下：</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">响应</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">文件必须在递交截止时间前上传</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">操作</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">流程</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">：本项目采用全流程电子化在线开评标方式，请各参选单位通过西南联合产权交易所阳光采购平台（</span>https://swueecg.com/#/index<span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">）</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">统一注册登录入口</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">，进入【供应商工作台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">投标系统</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">阳光采购平台</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">1.0</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">专区】，在线参与项目、递交</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">PDF</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">盖章版参选文件。参选文件递交截止时间前未完成参选文件上传的，视为放弃参选。参选过程中请密切通过阳光采购平台关注项目进度。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">五</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">、联系方式</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">联系人：</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">申先生</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16p